|passage="Why doubt his guilt?"<br>Wolfe's shoulders went up a fraction of an inch, and down again. "Divination. Contrariety."<br>"I see." Unger pursed his midget mouth, which didn't need pursing. "You're shooting at it '''on spec'''."}}

